{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794228528","published":"2026-11-09T12:48:59Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:23.252836377Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-115504"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-115504","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds write in ffgcls2() via variable-length string column\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115504.patch: check the string buffer bounds\n       before the read in ffgcls2()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115504-pre1.patch: enlarge the TDISPn\n       buffers in ffgcls() and ffgcdw(), required by the new ffgcdw() call\n       in ffgcls2()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115504-pre2.patch: range-check the TDISPn\n       width in ffgcdw(), required by the new ffgcdw() call in ffgcls2()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115504-2.patch: return the variable-length\n       string width from ffgcdw() and clamp the copy into the caller's\n       array; string reads are now truncated to a TDISPn width narrower\n       than TFORMn\n     - CVE-2026-115504","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libcfitsio-bin","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libcfitsio-bin?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.490-3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1794228528.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcfitsio-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libcfitsio-dev?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.490-3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1794228528.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcfitsio-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libcfitsio-doc?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.490-3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloud